import lib/std.dl

class:
    patterns:
        [an|] example action
    members:
        success as a boolean

function a successful example action:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("construct", an example action, true)

function a failed example action:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("construct", an example action, false)

function {example action:action} succeeded:
    execute:
        return action's success

flex function perform a successful example action:
    replacement:
        set the subject to a successful example action

flex function perform a failed example action:
    replacement:
        set the subject to a failed example action

function preserve subject through branch condition:
    execute:
        set the subject to a successful example action
        if condition:
            ignore 1
        else:
            ignore 2
        print whether it succeeded as a line

perform a successful example action and print whether it succeeded as a line
perform a failed example action and print whether it succeeded as a line
perform a successful example action
print whether it succeeded as a line
print whether true and false as a line
print whether true and true as a line
preserve subject through branch true
preserve subject through branch false
